Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:45.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to show them fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:54.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For that, the population of\Nearth will decrease by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.71,0:01:56.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it hardly matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:04.15,Default,,550,0,450,,Perfect \N Day \N For \N A \N Jungle \N Cruise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}...the cause is unknown.\NAs for the number of people...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:21.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me, Public Safety Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You got my message, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:43.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Batou, how is it?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:45.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The decay is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even a veteran inspector couldn't see\Nat a glance how long she's been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Not that, I'm asking what you think of it.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of... course...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was rough...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:04.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I told you to look at the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:07.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:12.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In the past two months,\Nthere have been five murder cases in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:16.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Adding the family of four killed today\Nmakes that six, for a total of 12 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:22.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The common link is that in every case the skin on the\Nvictim's upper body was removed in the shape of a t-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:30.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The results of the autopsies indicate a high probability\Nthat the victims were skinned alive and then left to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:31.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:34.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What does the profiler make of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:35.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:41.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it possible that this is the work of an anarchist\Nterrorist, or a ritual for some new cult?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:47.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, there's no possibility that this is the work of\Na religiously or politically motivated criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then could it be someone from the\Nsex crimes past-offenders list?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:53.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not a question of the criminal's perversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:56.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's not getting any pleasure our of these crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you base that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:03.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If there's anything there, it's obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Could there even be a serial murderer like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:12.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We were called, so there must\Nbe new information, right chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:19.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Marco Amoretti,\Na former sergeant in the American Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.31,0:04:26.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to our information from America, it's\Nextremely likely that he is committing these crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:32.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His service record data from the Ministry of Defence says that during\Nthe World War, he served on the front lines of various places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:38.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But in March of 2028,\Nhe was dismissed at his request.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since then, he has gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:45.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And the reason you think he's our man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:49.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was involved in a very similar case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A similar case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:52.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:58.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, if you know so much about him,\Nthen you've already worked it out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:04:59.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Through the Ministry of Foreign Affairs,\Nthe CIA issued a secret warrant for his arrest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:08.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the request for his unconditional\Nextradition was granted today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.61,0:05:13.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on, that's intervention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:14.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Basically...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:17.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why should we have to clean up after the CIA?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:19.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, we hope you'll somehow be willing to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let me introduce you.\NHe's just arrived from America, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Satou Suzuki of the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And Watanabe Tanaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:33.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Broadcast this to hostile countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:53.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This one will be the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:04.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appears he was pecked by\Nbirds until he was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are signs of a fight on the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:11.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so the prefecture police took back\Na piece of the ground as evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:15.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but there was no trace of the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:16.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:20.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Construction will begin here next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The crime scene will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:25.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We won't let it go for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:27.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Crane viewing place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder if there are any cranes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There aren't any cranes left\Nanymore, just crows now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:39.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey buddy, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:43.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there something you aren't telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:48.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, I'm also interested in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:49.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:53.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I find the guy,\Nit'll be his eternal farewell from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:57.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How theatrical.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:17.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, Batou? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:19.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:23.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey! Don't just take the liberty\Nof prying into someone's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:26.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're not yourself today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it has nothing to do with him right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:35.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, this is a cipher communication,\Njust stay silent and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:39.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If Batou goes berserk while working on this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you need to restrain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:49.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Horrible! There's nothing like\Ncanned coffee to wake you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:52.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Something's up, isn't it, between Batou and the suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:53.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:56.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But he's not at his usual state of concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:59.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood, I will do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ahh, I don't need caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If it tastes bad, just shut up and do some prep work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:07.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:08.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:16.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This case has been approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll stop our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:22.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll leave the negotiation\Nwith the prosecutor to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:29.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, since the suspect's being sought\Nby the CIA, this case will go unsolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, how to convince the guys in the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's also included in our job, to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:39.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have another request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:40.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.45,0:08:45.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major, how about you and Ishikawa try\Npoking around this prick's organisation.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:45.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, I don't have my card with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:45.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Roger.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:49.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Watanabe Tanaka-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:49.75,Comment,,0,0,900,,Note: This is an obviously fake name, like John Smith
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, please come to\Nheadquarters as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:08:59.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm in the middle of a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:03.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've found first hand\Nrecordings of the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.65,0:09:05.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:11.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well... It was being sold at a video\Nshop on Radio Street in New Port Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Pazu, Bouma, go to the\NElectronics District immediately.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:17.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Get the story from the video store owner.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Try to remove the records from the IR System.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.55,0:09:22.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Roger. Chief...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Hmm, you've found out?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It seems like Watanabe was anticipating that.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:44.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This place seems fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.87,0:09:46.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like we could gain some experience points here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:49.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}There's no time for any side quests.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:50.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Pazu, secure the surrounding stores.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Bouma, get the story from the owner.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:58.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Follow the source of the footage.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:09:59.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Roger.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:03.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pick up all the footage of\Ncustomers from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:04.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:06.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major, I think it will all work out somehow.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:17.73,Comment,,1200,0,900,,Note: They're talking about hacking into the CIA
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:10.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}At this rate, we won't even be able\Nto properly knock on their back door.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:11.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}They think they're keeping an eye on us, don't they?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I don't get much credit, do I.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:17.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}That's why we're going to try the back\Ndoor, maybe we can find something.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:22.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Watanabe-San, it seems the footage\Nthat was seized has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:23.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,May we look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:27.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, let's go over to that booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:29.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:32.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:34.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:05.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why did that bastard purposely\Ndistribute that kind of data?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:08.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because, for him, THAT is the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you think so, Satou-San?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:14.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what it's all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:18.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Before I came to Section 9, I was a Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:22.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I also have experience lurking\Nin the jungles of South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, what does that have to do with this data?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:28.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't act as if you don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:32.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That kept right on going even after\Nyou in the American Empire pulled out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:39.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And that nightmare shows itself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:43.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nightmare...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:09.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:14.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The criminal probably showed\Nthe video to the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:19.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You mean... so they could watch\Nthemselves being skinned alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:21.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:22.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.99,0:12:27.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like all six cases are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Ishikawa, did you find anything?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:33.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Yeah.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:36.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}As is to be expected from the\NCIA, there's strong protection,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}but Fort Plug has some records left.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:47.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In the CIA files, there are many reports of\NMarco undergoing psychological counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't there any more detailed information?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:52.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ah, hold on hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:54.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's this file?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:56.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Project Sunset?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:11.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Project Sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since you don't know about it, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:19.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,During the previous war,\Nin order to hurt enemy morale,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:25.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the CIA came up with an operation where\Nagents would sneak into enemy bases,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:31.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and after gaining the trust of the locals,\Nkill the women and children as brutally as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.57,0:13:33.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The codename was Project Sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You call that a strategy? You must be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:39.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That kind of project never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:42.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is our country's official position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:49.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Rumour has it that there were many cases where the soldiers\Nwho participated in these missions became mentally ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:51.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why would a person like that be on this street?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:54.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nobody knows these kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:58.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Guess we'll just have to look at the psychological\Nanalysts' horoscope-like reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:00.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:04.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His war has yet to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:18.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I've only heard rumours before,\Nbut I guess he really exists.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}However, if his goal is to\Nget rid of the spirit of war,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:26.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Marco will not stop his crimes as long as he's in this\Ncountry, which is apathetic to the deaths of others.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:32.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major, it seems Marco sold murder footage...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:35.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}to a bunch of homeless people living\Nin the park near Radio Street.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:38.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I'll send the files of the\Nseven cases that we've seized.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:42.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Seven cases? Yet another victim has appeared.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Send it over, fast.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:52.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please... stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:53.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,NO!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it, this time the visual\Ninformation is from the victim, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:02.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bouma, do you know the date\Nand time of the original file?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:03.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:07.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Determine the victim's\Naddress from the voice print.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's a chance that she's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:17.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm almost sorry that she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:21.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Skin regeneration technology is very advanced now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:23.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But it will never be completely\Nback to the way it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:28.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you happy about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the monster that you\Npeople created doing its job!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why we came to recycle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:36.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Recycle"? You Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:39.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop it! Choking this bastard to death\Nwont help anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:40.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:42.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you dare run away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:44.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I won't let him get away this time.\NI'll make sure to end his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:45.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:50.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see. If you had disposed of him, we\Nwouldn't have had to come all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you guys talking about? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where... where is that bastard hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:00.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about asking me for advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:05.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I've been touring\Nthe crime scenes with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What can you possibly tell us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:09.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on! What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:14.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's a sewer under here isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By sewer, you mean a storm drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:19.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Storm drain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:22.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, it's a covered stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:29.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Speaking of which, there's a storm drain running under the\Npark where that guy was passing data to homeless people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The path of the stream matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:40.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That bastard goes upstream to go commit a crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:43.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and then returns downstream to the city to spread it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:45.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As you said, he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Underneath our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:51.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You wait there! I'll hand you a body bag later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:03.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If Marco is moving through the storm drain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:06.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there's a good chance that\Nhe's using it as a hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:10.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bouma, you guys stay that way,\Nand come into the drain from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We'll surround him and catch that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:15.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, can I trust those words?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:17.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:23.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ugh, so damp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our visibility index for the\Noptical camouflage will go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:28.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Won't the gasket be corroded?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:31.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop talking,\Nyou should be glad you can't smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:34.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My sensor can analyse it you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:38.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you dislike it?\NYour discomfort level is at 68%!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:40.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:43.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:47.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a hidden trap for any\Nattack from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've found a hidden gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:54.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This humidity, the smell of decaying water...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.37,0:17:59.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right, this is definitely\Nthe jungle where we fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you saying to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:04.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, Batou! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, what's Batou doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:08.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He cut off his cyberbrain communication link.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:11.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The big guy has completely lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:12.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He seriously wants to kill Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:15.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:20.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The fibre-optic cables that are installed\Nin the tunnel are causing interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:25.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Try to hook up to the circuit station\Nthat the water department uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:26.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:32.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I found something outrageous\Nin the CIA's communication log.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:35.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,These bastards didn't want to bring\Nback Marco from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The order, "Make it look like an accident,\Nand get rid of the suspects", appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:40.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:43.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what this is about, isn't it?\NThey knew about Batou's past...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The CIA still has Batou's records.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:51.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He saw the aftermath of the Sunset\NProject when he was a Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:55.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those bastards, we've been used!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:59.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They planned to get rid of\NBatou and Marco from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:02.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no idea what\Nyou're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:10.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To begin with, your illegal access\Nof CIA data is already a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:14.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, restrain him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll explain the situation later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:17.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to where Batou's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:23.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:30.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're still on their "Jungle Cruise",\Nfighting their war in the wrong time and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:48.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:49.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you catch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:51.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry, he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:53.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're so unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:55.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold up, you can't go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:05.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:18.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Marco!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:24.20,Default,,350,0,500,,Pump Room \N \N Authorised Personnel Only
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:27.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's finish this already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:05.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:09.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:12.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please, kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:14.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:19.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, use that knife and peel off my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:21.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:25.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:31.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You think that will release you from your mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:32.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What conceit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:50.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My war is already over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.69,0:22:11.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We only have return tickets for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:15.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Quit screwing around! Sorry it's\NMarco instead of a body bag, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:19.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you think I'd shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:25.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The idea did cross my mind to try to clear my\Nsullied name with some archaic form of justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.89,0:22:31.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but you can't change the past so\NI'll carry this with me to my grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:37.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This isn't his Jungle,\Nthis is our city and I'm a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.81,0:22:47.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We didn't save just one person this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
